OL,3,GNEWSAHow hospital cinemas are
OL,4,Atransforming patient care
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitals can be scary places for
OL,7,Fchildren with new sights, sounds and
OL,8,Fsmells, but an in-house cinema is
OL,9,Fhelping to change patients'
OL,10,Fexperiences.
OL,12,FFilled with colourful seats, the
OL,13,FMediCinema at Birmingham Children's
OL,14,FHospital is specially designed to
OL,15,Faccommodate beds, wheelchairs and
OL,16,Fmedical equipment so children can watch
OL,17,Fthe latest films for free.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
