OL,3,GNEWSAHow hospital cinemas are
OL,4,Atransforming patient care
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven-year-old Foxx was diagnosed with
OL,7,FWilms tumour in 2024, a type of kidney
OL,8,Fcancer that mainly affects children,
OL,9,Fand frequently attends the cinema with
OL,10,Ffriends from other wards.
OL,12,F"When I come into hospital, I feel
OL,13,Fhappy because I get to watch movies and
OL,14,Fit takes my mind off things," she said.
